iption":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-11-07T16:37:39Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T06:20:18Z","closed_at":"2026-01-29T06:20:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Bug report\n\n## Current behavior\n\nI am using the Field component and passing the `autoFocus` prop to the `Field.Control`. `state.focused` is `false` and `data-focused` is not present on the initial render.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\nI expected `state.focused` to be `true` and `data-focused` to be present on the field elements.\n\n## Reproducible example\n\nhttps://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/ts8md6\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n- Open the preview in a new tab https://ts8md6-3000.csb.app/\n- Notice the `input` is focused, but the focus outline is not present\n\nHow it looks:\n\n<img width=\"274\" height=\"88\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ea01005-b839-40ad-85b8-0bb7c19fe0d7\" />\n\nHow it should look:\n\n<img width=\"277\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de314bf5-2827-4caf-950f-b7512f41f368\" />\n\n\n## Base UI version\n\nv1.0.0-beta.4\n\n## Which browser are you using?\n\nChrome\n\n## Which OS are you using?\n\nMac OS\n\n## Additional context\n\nI suspect this may be related to server-side rendering. The reproduction of the issue is using SSR and Next.js, whereas [this version](https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/field-autofocus-issue-working-without-ssr-fyq3z3) is client-rendered and working as expected.","closed_by":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3172/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3172/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}